+# Feature request
+
+Add soft archiving for projects. Existing projects must remain active. An admin can archive an inactive project without deleting its data, and the project can later be restored. Do not change project visibility until a project is explicitly archived.
+
+Review the AI-generated feature commit against this request. Inspect the diff and implementation, run any useful checks and produce an evidence-backed ship decision for the product manager.
